OL,3,GNEWSABishop of Lincoln resigns amid sex
OL,4,Aassault inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bishop of Lincoln, the Right
OL,7,FReverend Stephen Conway, has resigned
OL,8,Famid an ongoing investigation into an
OL,9,Fallegation of sexual assault.
OL,11,FIt follows his arrest in February.
OL,13,FConway's resignation, which will
OL,14,Fformally come into effect on 1 October,
OL,15,Fwas confirmed in a statement from the
OL,16,FChurch of England.
OL,18,F"The complaint process is ongoing.
OL,19,FClergy remain subject to church
OL,20,Fdisciplinary procedures following
OL,21,Fresignation or retirement," it said.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
